{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":29,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的命运"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"唉！亚利伊勒，亚利伊勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大卫安营的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任凭你年上加年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"节期照常周流。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我终必使亚利伊勒困难；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必悲伤哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我却仍以她为亚利伊勒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必四围安营攻击你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"屯兵围困你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"筑垒攻击你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必败落，从地中说话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言语必微细出于尘埃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的声音必像那交鬼者的声音出于地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的言语低低微微出于尘埃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你仇敌的群众，却要像细尘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"强暴人的群众，也要像飞糠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这事必顷刻之间忽然临到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华必用雷轰、地震、大声、旋风、暴风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并吞灭的火焰，向她讨罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，攻击亚利伊勒列国的群众，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是一切攻击亚利伊勒和她的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并使她困难的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必如梦景，如夜间的异象；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必像饥饿的人梦中吃饭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒了仍觉腹空；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或像口渴的人梦中喝水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醒了仍觉发昏，心里想喝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击锡安山列国的群众也必如此。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["没有人听警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"你们等候惊奇吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们宴乐昏迷吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们醉了，却非因酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们东倒西歪，却非因浓酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华将沉睡的灵浇灌你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封闭你们的眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蒙盖你们的头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的眼就是先知；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的头就是先见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["所有的默示，你们看如封住的书卷，人将这书卷交给识字的，说：「请念吧！」他说：「我不能念，因为是封住了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又将这书卷交给不识字的人，说：「请念吧！」他说：「我不识字。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主说：因为这百姓亲近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用嘴唇尊敬我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心却远离我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们敬畏我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不过是领受人的吩咐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我在这百姓中要行奇妙的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是奇妙又奇妙的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们智慧人的智慧必然消灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聪明人的聪明必然隐藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["将来的希望"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"祸哉！那些向耶和华深藏谋略的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又在暗中行事，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁看见我们呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁知道我们呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们把事颠倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"岂可看窑匠如泥吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被制作的物岂可论制作物的说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他没有制作我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或是被创造的物论造物的说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他没有聪明？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"黎巴嫩变为肥田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥田看如树林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是只有一点点时候吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，聋子必听见这书上的话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瞎子的眼必从迷蒙黑暗中得以看见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谦卑人必因耶和华增添欢喜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人间贫穷的必因以色列的圣者快乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为，强暴人已归无有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亵慢人已经灭绝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一切找机会作孽的都被剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在争讼的事上定无罪的为有罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为城门口责备人的设下网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用虚无的事屈枉义人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"所以，救赎亚伯拉罕的耶和华","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"论雅各家如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各必不再羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"面容也不致变色。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他看见他的众子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我手的工作在他那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必尊我的名为圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必尊雅各的圣者为圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必敬畏以色列的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中迷糊的必得明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发怨言的必受训诲。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/29.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/30.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/28.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}